### Additional context

I am trying to build `imgui[glfw-binding]` for `wasm32-emscripten`. Currently it depends on the `glfw3` packgae for all plantforms. 
Issue is that `glfw3` package should not be required for `wasm32-emscripten`. But currently it is set as requirement and could not build (see failure logs above).

I was able to install `imgui[glfw-binding]:wasm32-emscripten` by removing `glfw3` dependecy for emscripten platform.

I've edited files in the `vcpkg/ports/imgui/` directory:
```diff
