**Additional pre-build steps**:
Emscripten requires some additional steps for build:
1. installing and activating SDK
2. running cmake with emcmake wrapper
3. chainloading tollchain:
```
emcmake cmake -S . -B buildem "-DVCPKG_CHAINLOAD_TOOLCHAIN_FILE=%EMSDK%/upstream/emscripten/cmake/Modules/Platform/Emscripten.cmake" "-DVCPKG_TARGET_TRIPLET=wasm32-emscripten" "-DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release"
```

**Notes:**
In Cmake I use `${EMSCRIPTEN}` variable (set by emscripten build enivroment) to detect emscripten platform and disable dependency from  glfw3. 
